WEBVTT

01:30.600 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:40.440
BRIGHT SNOWY PAVILION

01:52.440 --> 01:53.560
Fate,

01:53.640 --> 01:56.760
I ordered you to urge
Demon Lord to become the strongest,

01:56.840 --> 01:58.520
but are you really

01:58.600 --> 02:01.680
helping him or hindering him?

02:01.760 --> 02:03.440
Helping him is a common method,

02:03.960 --> 02:05.800
and hindering him is the best.

02:06.480 --> 02:07.760
Given the Demon Lord's nature,

02:07.840 --> 02:09.080
the more resistance he receives,

02:09.160 --> 02:11.240
the faster he will become the strongest.

02:15.760 --> 02:16.920
Ten thousand years ago,

02:17.000 --> 02:20.200
you removed the celestial punishment
for the Chaos Pearl,

02:20.280 --> 02:21.880
so you were destined to be trapped

02:21.960 --> 02:23.760
and have your soul
gradually devoured by feelings.

02:23.840 --> 02:25.400
After being reincarnated as a human being,

02:25.480 --> 02:28.040
you will never be loved for generations.

02:28.120 --> 02:30.600
Now, you have turned back
into a divine artifact,

02:30.680 --> 02:33.440
and your soul will continue to be devoured

02:33.520 --> 02:35.720
until you die.

02:38.960 --> 02:40.720
Apart from me,

02:40.800 --> 02:43.040
no one can suppress or remove
the celestial punishment

02:43.120 --> 02:45.320
caused by feelings.

02:45.400 --> 02:47.120
If you wish to continue to exist,

02:47.200 --> 02:48.880
you must remain loyal to me

02:48.960 --> 02:50.760
and never defect.

02:50.840 --> 02:52.600
Act faster.

02:52.680 --> 02:55.360
I must go to earth.

03:04.600 --> 03:05.680
How much time is left?

03:09.400 --> 03:10.320
Time

03:11.080 --> 03:12.240
is quite different

03:13.160 --> 03:14.280
for life

03:14.840 --> 03:16.400
and death.

03:17.200 --> 03:18.920
It depends on whether one

03:19.560 --> 03:21.080
is seeking life or death.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.480
You can see through life and death

03:25.240 --> 03:26.440
and know everything,

03:27.960 --> 03:29.560
so you knew Xuanxin was my brother

03:30.160 --> 03:31.120
long ago, didn't you?

03:32.400 --> 03:33.560
It's not long ago,

03:34.520 --> 03:36.000
but it's also not recent.

03:36.080 --> 03:37.840
Everything happens

03:38.880 --> 03:40.880
for a reason.

03:42.120 --> 03:43.680
I can only see the end

03:44.520 --> 03:46.040
through divination,

03:47.240 --> 03:48.760
but The Book of Fate

03:50.200 --> 03:52.080
can see everything.

03:53.240 --> 03:54.800
Back then, my brother was dying.

03:55.880 --> 03:57.120
You read my fortune

03:58.520 --> 03:59.600
and told me that my bond

03:59.680 --> 04:01.320
with my brother was over.

04:03.080 --> 04:04.160
Then,

04:04.800 --> 04:06.240
even though I had access
to spirit medicine,

04:06.920 --> 04:09.280
I couldn't save him
from the evil cultivator

04:10.240 --> 04:12.440
and had to watch him be taken away.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.680
I thought

04:15.880 --> 04:16.800
that was the end,

04:17.880 --> 04:19.480
but my brother survived

04:20.000 --> 04:21.480
and was saved by the Xuantian Sect.

04:23.520 --> 04:24.600
However,

04:26.320 --> 04:27.840
your divination

04:27.920 --> 04:29.720
did reveal the true end.

04:33.280 --> 04:34.480
There is no longer any chance

04:36.560 --> 04:38.480
of lasting my kinship with him.

04:43.680 --> 04:45.160
Such a kinship

04:47.080 --> 04:48.560
is killed like this.

04:51.320 --> 04:52.680
Have you really thought about it?

05:01.200 --> 05:04.320
I am on a different path from him.

05:05.640 --> 05:07.920
He's a leader with a heart for the world,

05:08.920 --> 05:10.160
who would destroy his own abilities

05:10.760 --> 05:11.760
to protect the people

05:13.040 --> 05:14.720
and doesn't have any dirt in his mind,

05:16.040 --> 05:17.080
whereas I walk around

05:18.600 --> 05:20.200
in black and white,

05:21.320 --> 05:22.640
covered in dust.

05:23.240 --> 05:24.600
How would he react

05:25.960 --> 05:27.000
if I confessed to him who I am,

05:28.480 --> 05:30.120
and how would I deal with it?

05:35.640 --> 05:37.000
You're so much alike.

05:38.800 --> 05:41.040
You're both lonely but brave

05:42.000 --> 05:44.120
for what you believe in.

05:48.520 --> 05:49.840
After you come to Snow City this time,

05:50.960 --> 05:52.200
whatever you want,

05:52.800 --> 05:55.080
promise me you won't hurt him.

06:00.000 --> 06:01.520
I've already given you
the Black Wood Seal.

06:01.600 --> 06:03.000
Please don't involve Bao again.

06:04.040 --> 06:05.760
If the Demon Lord is not destroyed,

06:05.840 --> 06:07.200
the scourge will always be unpredictable,

06:08.600 --> 06:11.400
so who in this world can stay out of it?

06:16.680 --> 06:18.680
I don't know what he intends to do,

06:18.760 --> 06:20.920
but I felt a strong Jade Vault Power

06:21.000 --> 06:23.040
as the demonic power
traveled through my body.

06:23.120 --> 06:24.280
This is the proof.

06:24.800 --> 06:25.840
I'm sure

06:25.920 --> 06:27.600
Senior is still inside the Demon Lord

06:27.680 --> 06:28.760
and hasn't melted away.

06:29.280 --> 06:30.320
In time,

06:31.000 --> 06:32.200
we will be able to awaken him.

06:32.720 --> 06:33.920
What

06:34.000 --> 06:36.040
is the Demon Lord's secret?

06:36.120 --> 06:38.120
Now, I can't fight him,

06:38.200 --> 06:39.480
so I have to find a way

06:40.080 --> 06:41.880
to observe his heart with the seal

06:41.960 --> 06:43.720
and save Gao Qiumin and the others.

06:56.360 --> 06:58.000
It's the night of the full moon.

06:58.080 --> 07:00.760
How boring for you
to be alone in your room.

07:02.120 --> 07:03.240
Why don't you

07:03.920 --> 07:05.240
drink with me?

07:07.640 --> 07:09.240
How dare you?

07:11.520 --> 07:12.600
Get out.

07:15.720 --> 07:18.880
Can't you be nice to me
because I brought you

07:18.960 --> 07:21.040
good wine?

07:27.560 --> 07:28.800
What?

07:28.880 --> 07:29.960
Dare not drink it?

07:30.720 --> 07:31.600
Afraid I'll poison it?

07:39.800 --> 07:43.720
Sometimes, it's less fun

07:43.800 --> 07:45.160
to be too defensive.

07:48.800 --> 07:51.000
My pleasure is to kill.

07:51.080 --> 07:52.760
If you don't leave,

07:52.840 --> 07:55.800
I'll start with those two
at the Lava Chasm.

07:55.880 --> 07:57.920
They're going to die
sooner or later anyway,

07:58.480 --> 07:59.960
so if you kill them tonight,

08:00.040 --> 08:01.840
they'll be less tortured

08:01.920 --> 08:03.160
at the Lava Chasm,

08:04.040 --> 08:05.760
which is probably a good thing.

08:06.520 --> 08:08.760
Whether it's now or 10,000 years ago,

08:08.840 --> 08:10.640
they've met the right people.

08:11.200 --> 08:12.600
What a call to envy.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.600
But what about you and me?

08:15.680 --> 08:17.800
I want Xie Xuechen back.

08:18.480 --> 08:20.000
And you hate that I'm not Pearl.

08:20.920 --> 08:22.160
In the end,

08:22.240 --> 08:24.320
we can't get what we want,

08:24.920 --> 08:26.040
and we just torture each other.

08:29.400 --> 08:30.480
Who says I can't?

08:31.200 --> 08:33.159
I want the Chaos Power

08:34.799 --> 08:36.720
and nothing else.

08:47.320 --> 08:49.080
Did your seal

08:50.240 --> 08:51.840
tell you the result?

08:54.720 --> 08:56.800
Didn't you already know?

08:56.880 --> 08:58.600
No one can observe

08:58.680 --> 09:00.520
if the one being observed

09:00.600 --> 09:01.840
knows in advance and is on guard.

09:01.920 --> 09:03.360
Isn't that just right?

09:03.440 --> 09:05.640
Why don't we experience observing the body

09:07.280 --> 09:08.360
and mind for ourselves?

09:13.440 --> 09:14.600
It's just what I wanted.

09:33.560 --> 09:34.640
He's really hurt.

09:35.400 --> 09:37.520
I didn't realize even Demon Lord

09:37.600 --> 09:39.280
could be hurt so badly.

09:47.400 --> 09:49.040
It's just torture from the Lava Chasm.

09:49.560 --> 09:51.800
Put away your pitying eyes.

09:51.880 --> 09:53.440
I'm not Xie Xuechen,

09:54.400 --> 09:55.760
so I don't need your comfort.

09:56.360 --> 09:57.760
But the wound on your arm

09:58.480 --> 10:00.040
wasn't caused by the Lava Chasm, was it?

10:02.880 --> 10:05.320
That was the wound Pearl bandaged for you
back when she went to the barracks.

10:05.400 --> 10:07.280
I purposely left that wound

10:11.120 --> 10:12.880
in order to remind myself

10:14.400 --> 10:15.960
not to forget the hatred of the past.

10:17.720 --> 10:18.800
Really?

10:21.920 --> 10:23.640
The ones who suffered but didn't retaliate

10:24.160 --> 10:25.520
were Xie Xuechen

10:25.600 --> 10:26.760
and Zhao Ming,

10:28.200 --> 10:29.440
not me.

10:33.280 --> 10:35.360
I will make everyone in this world

10:36.120 --> 10:37.240
join me

10:38.000 --> 10:39.600
in eternal purgatory.

10:43.320 --> 10:44.360
You…

10:45.520 --> 10:47.400
You can't observe my heart anymore.

10:47.920 --> 10:48.760
Get lost.

10:49.680 --> 10:50.880
Otherwise,

10:51.880 --> 10:52.840
I don't mind digging out

10:52.920 --> 10:54.840
the hearts of those two people
for you to observe.

10:58.000 --> 10:58.840
Got it.

10:59.480 --> 11:00.640
Right away.

11:20.640 --> 11:23.000
Who says observing hearts
has to be done with a seal?

11:23.920 --> 11:25.880
The scars on your body

11:25.960 --> 11:27.520
already tell.

11:31.600 --> 11:33.520
It's a full moon tonight,

11:33.600 --> 11:34.920
but there seems

11:35.000 --> 11:36.800
to be too much peace in the Dark Abyss.

11:38.520 --> 11:39.680
Take it easy.

11:40.840 --> 11:42.640
A stone already in a deep pool

11:43.440 --> 11:45.360
is bound to cause the ripples.

12:01.560 --> 12:02.600
Yan Tong.

12:04.920 --> 12:05.760
You killed him?

12:09.800 --> 12:11.520
I did want to kill him,

12:12.120 --> 12:13.120
but someone else

12:13.200 --> 12:14.920
deserved to die.

12:27.040 --> 12:29.200
Is it me Your Grace is referring to

12:30.000 --> 12:31.280
as the one who deserves to die?

12:32.120 --> 12:33.520
Then you have truly misjudged me

12:34.200 --> 12:35.680
for that you gave yourself

12:35.760 --> 12:38.040
this seal.

12:41.040 --> 12:42.680
I am still of use to Demon Lord,

12:43.400 --> 12:44.600
so if you kill me,

12:45.480 --> 12:47.520
he will not spare you.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.600
Don't worry.

12:48.680 --> 12:50.400
You are more useful to me.

12:51.200 --> 12:54.000
I'm just going to break
the Black Wood Seal into you.

12:54.680 --> 12:55.520
It won't kill you.

12:56.120 --> 12:57.640
Black Wood Seal?

12:57.720 --> 12:59.400
I don't mind telling you.

13:00.680 --> 13:01.720
If I can lure the Demon Lord

13:01.800 --> 13:04.120
into using his demonic power
to activate the Black Wood Seal,

13:04.200 --> 13:05.720
the night of the full moon

13:05.800 --> 13:07.760
will be when
the Demon Lord's power is at its lowest.

13:08.840 --> 13:09.800
The power of Fate

13:10.640 --> 13:12.200
can recast the seal of the Lava Chasm

13:13.040 --> 13:14.240
to suppress Demon Lord once again.

13:15.560 --> 13:17.600
You want to activate the Black Wood Seal

13:18.760 --> 13:21.960
by using my body as an intermediary
while Demon Lord

13:22.960 --> 13:24.200
transfers his power into me?

13:26.640 --> 13:27.760
That's right,

13:28.680 --> 13:30.240
but you'll soon forget it.

13:34.320 --> 13:38.520
Do you think the Black Wood Seal alone
can trap me?

13:43.680 --> 13:46.840
Your Grace. Why did you resort to a method

13:46.920 --> 13:49.000
that would be damaging to both of us?

13:49.800 --> 13:51.280
The more you use your demonic power,

13:52.080 --> 13:53.760
the stronger the seal becomes.

13:54.360 --> 13:56.200
I kill on my own terms,

13:56.840 --> 13:58.080
regardless of the consequences.

13:59.320 --> 14:01.640
Then the Lava Chasm is where you belong.

14:05.560 --> 14:07.520
The Divine Emperor, help me.

14:09.000 --> 14:11.480
You want me to betray the Demon Lord?

14:12.000 --> 14:13.200
I'm afraid I'll have to disappoint you.

14:16.880 --> 14:18.040
Now that you're here,

14:18.600 --> 14:20.160
it's clear
that you're trying to betray him.

14:22.120 --> 14:24.800
The Dark Clan was born of inner demons,

14:25.560 --> 14:26.560
so this is nothing.

14:28.280 --> 14:30.600
Do you not want to be,

14:31.960 --> 14:32.800
or are you unable to be

14:34.120 --> 14:35.200
the Lord of the Dark Abyss?

14:39.680 --> 14:42.360
Either way, I will help
the Dark Abyss get a new leader.

14:42.440 --> 14:43.480
There are probably many people

14:43.560 --> 14:45.440
in the Dark Abyss who want

14:46.400 --> 14:47.800
to be the new Demon Lord.

14:49.480 --> 14:51.080
Why did you choose me?

14:51.160 --> 14:52.400
Anger Demon is reckless,

14:53.160 --> 14:54.200
and Desire Demon is indecisive,

14:56.200 --> 14:57.080
so you fit the bill.

15:00.320 --> 15:02.200
We think alike,

15:02.720 --> 15:03.720
but

15:04.880 --> 15:06.320
can you tell me

15:07.200 --> 15:08.720
what it is you're after?

15:10.000 --> 15:11.040
I want everything back

15:12.520 --> 15:14.360
the way it was.

15:22.000 --> 15:24.400
You really are always teaming up

15:25.000 --> 15:26.360
with despicable ones, as usual.

15:39.400 --> 15:41.040
Unbind me now.

15:41.120 --> 15:42.400
You can't handle them alone.

15:43.000 --> 15:44.120
Demon Lord is a sinful man,

15:45.720 --> 15:47.520
so he must be re-sealed

15:48.040 --> 15:49.200
and suppressed in the Lava Chasm.

15:49.280 --> 15:51.800
If you hadn't agreed
to the other immortals' petition

15:51.880 --> 15:53.240
and forcibly changed Zhao Ming's destiny,

15:53.840 --> 15:55.440
how could there be a Demon Lord today?

15:55.960 --> 15:57.320
I think the sinful one
is somebody like you,

15:57.400 --> 16:00.000
who turned black and white upside down
and caused him to become a demon.

16:00.600 --> 16:02.320
Everything has a cause and effect.

16:03.040 --> 16:05.120
If Zhao Ming hadn't insisted
on killing immortals,

16:06.520 --> 16:08.120
how could they have petitioned me?

16:08.200 --> 16:10.280
If I insist on protecting him today,

16:11.160 --> 16:12.720
what will you do?

16:14.040 --> 16:15.360
Strike the Black Wood Seal

16:15.960 --> 16:17.520
into the Demon Lord's heart

16:17.600 --> 16:19.400
to complete the final step of the seal.

16:24.160 --> 16:25.880
Your Grace, please savor

16:25.960 --> 16:27.800
the pain of a heart slaying.

16:55.160 --> 16:56.000
Mu Xuanling.

17:17.520 --> 17:19.440
Why is it that Black Wood Seal
not only didn't seal him

17:19.520 --> 17:21.400
but also went
to the Lava Chasm in his place?

17:23.119 --> 17:25.880
A dead man doesn't deserve to know.

17:36.960 --> 17:39.920
He didn't spread Yan Tong's power
over his whole body

17:40.000 --> 17:42.320
but made it avoid
the most crucial part, his heart,

17:42.400 --> 17:44.720
so that he could counterattack
and control Black Wood Seal

17:44.800 --> 17:46.760
in order to have Black Wood Seal

17:46.840 --> 17:48.400
suppressed in the Lava Chasm in his place.

17:48.480 --> 17:49.680
As I wished.

17:55.920 --> 17:57.040
The Book of Fate's true form

17:57.640 --> 17:58.960
is nothing more than this.

18:08.280 --> 18:09.440
If my soul is captured

18:09.960 --> 18:11.640
by an outlaw after I die,

18:12.400 --> 18:13.600
they will not be able to do evil

18:14.320 --> 18:16.040
with this limitation.

18:16.120 --> 18:17.160
Ridiculous.

18:17.760 --> 18:18.840
IN ANCIENT TIMES, THERE WERE TEN SUNS

18:18.920 --> 18:20.040
NINE OF WHICH WERE STRUCK DOWN
AND BURIED IN DARK CLOUD

18:20.120 --> 18:21.280
THE POWER OF THE NINE SUNS
REMOVES THE RESTRICTION

18:23.120 --> 18:25.320
The power of the nine suns
removes the restriction.

18:26.760 --> 18:28.360
Dark Cloud Mountain.

18:29.440 --> 18:31.080
All crap.

18:32.040 --> 18:34.040
I'd better destroy it.

18:40.120 --> 18:41.360
Has the plan failed?

18:43.120 --> 18:44.520
Demon Lord's strength

18:44.600 --> 18:47.200
and intellect
still cannot be underestimated.

18:47.800 --> 18:49.240
What should you do next?

18:51.080 --> 18:52.600
As long as he can trust Mu Xuanling,

18:53.200 --> 18:55.800
the plan after that can still continue.

18:55.880 --> 18:56.880
If the plan is in order,

18:57.720 --> 18:59.200
why do you look so bad?

19:06.440 --> 19:07.480
I just have limited patience.

19:43.760 --> 19:49.640
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

19:49.720 --> 19:52.440
The Xuanling Tree
only blooms in the Dark Abyss.

19:52.520 --> 19:53.960
In the human realm,

19:54.040 --> 19:56.480
only one survives in the courtyard
of the Swirling Snow Pavilion.

19:57.080 --> 19:58.720
Someone once told me

19:59.880 --> 20:02.360
that the Xuanling Tree
can grow up in the human realm,

20:03.080 --> 20:06.200
and I can find my own place
in the human realm,

20:07.120 --> 20:10.160
but a Xuanling Tree that can't bloom

20:12.200 --> 20:13.960
is not a real Xuanling Tree.

20:15.000 --> 20:17.080
You just woke up and started reminiscing.

20:17.880 --> 20:19.200
You seem to be enjoying yourself,

20:19.880 --> 20:21.320
but I'm not interested.

20:23.320 --> 20:24.600
Well…

20:25.200 --> 20:26.920
Then I'll say something you want to hear.

20:27.760 --> 20:29.920
After so many days and what happened,

20:30.520 --> 20:31.680
I realized

20:32.600 --> 20:34.360
that going against you won't end well,

20:35.400 --> 20:36.960
so I'm willing to cooperate with you

20:37.760 --> 20:39.520
and give you all the Chaos Power.

20:46.040 --> 20:48.280
You want me to let
Gao Qiumin and Fu Lansheng go.

20:48.360 --> 20:49.320
And Yan Tong.

20:50.520 --> 20:51.880
His spiritual power
has been greatly damaged,

20:52.480 --> 20:53.800
so he's useless to you,

20:56.320 --> 20:59.800
but before I give you the Chaos Power,

20:59.880 --> 21:01.000
I have to take two things,

21:01.760 --> 21:03.240
Lotus of Life

21:03.320 --> 21:04.440
and Jun Tian Sword,

21:05.880 --> 21:07.600
to build a grave for Xie Xuechen,

21:08.200 --> 21:10.560
to remind me that he has passed away,

21:10.640 --> 21:13.200
and to cut off all relations
with the human realm

21:13.920 --> 21:15.560
and my delusion from now on.

21:17.480 --> 21:19.040
If you don't trust me,

21:19.120 --> 21:20.480
you can come with me.

21:21.560 --> 21:22.680
Okay.

21:23.440 --> 21:26.360
So, you agreed?

21:27.800 --> 21:29.960
I don't care what you're up to.

21:30.920 --> 21:33.400
I only care about what I want,

21:37.640 --> 21:40.120
but there's one thing
you need to remember.

21:44.280 --> 21:45.960
Don't betray me again.

21:46.760 --> 21:47.640
Otherwise,

21:48.600 --> 21:49.720
I will really kill you.

21:56.720 --> 21:58.200
Why did Demon Lord suddenly release us?

22:00.200 --> 22:02.880
Maybe he hasn't forgotten
his old relationship with you guys.

22:09.040 --> 22:10.440
I'll accompany you here.

22:11.200 --> 22:12.560
Aren't you coming with us?

22:13.320 --> 22:16.120
I've come to join Demon Lord.
Why should I go?

22:17.560 --> 22:18.880
Have you

22:18.960 --> 22:20.440
observed the Demon Lord's heart?

22:22.480 --> 22:23.680
The past is gone.

22:24.560 --> 22:25.680
Demon Lord is Demon Lord.

22:27.640 --> 22:29.000
Are you in some kind of trouble?

22:29.520 --> 22:30.760
Tell us.

22:30.840 --> 22:33.120
If we fight with all our might now,
we can take you with us.

22:34.720 --> 22:36.480
Why are you talking so much nonsense?

22:36.560 --> 22:37.560
Just go.

22:37.640 --> 22:39.280
If Demon Lord changes his mind,

22:39.880 --> 22:40.720
we'll all die here.

22:43.480 --> 22:44.680
Mu Xuanling.

23:01.920 --> 23:03.080
Based on Miss Mu's character,

23:03.160 --> 23:05.280
I think she has her own plans.

23:06.160 --> 23:07.480
Let's go first.

23:07.560 --> 23:08.600
Don't get in her way.

23:11.240 --> 23:12.760
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

23:12.840 --> 23:14.920
Mu Xuanling just saw
the three of them off.

23:15.000 --> 23:17.720
She didn't do

23:17.800 --> 23:19.720
or say anything suspicious.

23:20.440 --> 23:23.120
Do you think there's something wrong?

23:23.200 --> 23:25.200
Should we follow them
to the Immortal Alliance?

23:25.280 --> 23:26.400
No.

23:27.800 --> 23:29.280
Just stay here.

23:30.600 --> 23:32.320
After I leave,

23:32.840 --> 23:34.720
if anyone
from the Immortal Alliance breaks in,

23:35.520 --> 23:36.760
kill them on sight.

23:36.840 --> 23:38.080
-Got it.
-Got it.

23:40.280 --> 23:41.120
Your Grace.

23:41.200 --> 23:43.880
I used to deal with Mu Xuanling.

23:43.960 --> 23:45.520
She's a trickster,

23:45.600 --> 23:47.800
but why did you agree to leave with her?

23:50.520 --> 23:52.160
I have my own plans.

23:53.720 --> 23:55.840
There is something I must have
at Dark Cloud Mountain.

23:56.480 --> 23:57.920
As for Jun Tian Sword,

23:58.440 --> 24:00.240
it was originally my sword,

24:01.120 --> 24:03.240
but now that Jun Tian has disobeyed me,

24:03.960 --> 24:05.200
I will have to retrieve it myself.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.800
-Just go.
-Got it.

24:13.440 --> 24:15.520
Let's go. To Ethereal Jade Island.

24:16.880 --> 24:18.520
Aren't you going to keep
an eye on me yourself?

24:19.400 --> 24:21.440
Do I need to follow your orders?

24:25.320 --> 24:28.320
So, Your Grace, where are you going now?

24:28.400 --> 24:29.240
Ethereal Jade Island.

24:36.160 --> 24:37.640
Phoenix Perch Forest is treacherous,

24:37.720 --> 24:39.520
so you'd better get the restraints off me.

24:39.600 --> 24:40.800
I already did.

24:41.520 --> 24:42.560
When?

24:42.640 --> 24:43.520
Just now.

24:44.160 --> 24:45.480
Why don't I know?

24:45.560 --> 24:47.440
Do I need to let you know?

24:48.400 --> 24:50.520
-You're so bossy.
-You've finally realized.

24:56.280 --> 24:58.320
There are lethal or hallucinogenic miasmas

24:58.400 --> 24:59.760
and forest spirits in the forest,

25:00.560 --> 25:02.240
so we'd better stay close.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.720
It's just forest spirits.

25:05.960 --> 25:07.440
We could just kill them.

25:09.320 --> 25:10.680
The forest spirit's ability to mesmerize

25:10.760 --> 25:12.480
has nothing to do with one's strength.

25:13.120 --> 25:15.720
The more obsessive they are,
the more dangerous they are.

25:15.800 --> 25:17.160
Obsession?

25:18.480 --> 25:20.360
I won't be trapped by that.

25:21.400 --> 25:22.360
Ling.

25:23.520 --> 25:24.560
Wait.

25:34.520 --> 25:36.280
Ling. You go first.

25:37.520 --> 25:39.680
Now that Demon Lord
is in the miasma of Phoenix Perch Forest

25:39.760 --> 25:40.600
and his demonic energy
has been suppressed,

25:41.520 --> 25:43.360
I've been able to separate
from him for a while.

25:44.480 --> 25:46.400
Wait for me. I will kill him.

25:47.160 --> 25:49.960
If I can regain my body,
I will come back to you.

25:50.680 --> 25:51.640
If I fail,

25:51.720 --> 25:54.200
return to the Immortal Alliance
and rally the people against him.

26:01.680 --> 26:02.640
Forest spirit.

26:03.280 --> 26:04.840
That was brilliant.

26:06.520 --> 26:08.240
You are worthy of the Chaos Saintess.

26:09.440 --> 26:10.280
Let's go.

26:11.560 --> 26:12.680
You're a fake, too.

26:13.200 --> 26:15.040
Demon Lord won't recognize me
as Chaos Saintess.

26:16.120 --> 26:18.240
As far as he's concerned, I'm not Pearl.

26:22.240 --> 26:23.400
Mu Xuanling.

26:24.880 --> 26:25.960
Mu Xuanling.

26:26.480 --> 26:27.760
Zhao Ming.

26:29.000 --> 26:30.120
Who are you calling?

26:31.840 --> 26:33.040
Pearl.

26:44.400 --> 26:46.480
The dangers of the Phoenix Perch Forest

26:46.560 --> 26:48.280
have nothing to do with one's strength

26:49.480 --> 26:50.400
but with mind.

26:51.640 --> 26:53.520
Pearl has been
his obsession for 10,000 years.

26:54.040 --> 26:55.280
I used Pearl as bait

26:55.360 --> 26:57.160
to set a trap.

26:57.680 --> 26:58.680
It's a trap

26:59.480 --> 27:01.040
he must enter.

27:02.320 --> 27:03.960
The deeper the obsession,

27:04.040 --> 27:05.840
the deeper he will fall,

27:06.600 --> 27:08.520
even if he is the Demon Lord.

27:09.040 --> 27:11.440
What will happen to the Demon Lord
if he can't leave Phoenix Perch Forest?

27:12.840 --> 27:14.160
He will be lost in his dreams

27:14.880 --> 27:16.440
and trapped in his illusion forever,

27:17.120 --> 27:19.400
until he disappears from the real world.

27:19.920 --> 27:21.920
If he disappears completely,

27:22.640 --> 27:24.480
how will you explain that to Hao Tian?

27:27.920 --> 27:29.120
I'd have to

27:29.720 --> 27:30.800
give up explaining.

27:37.080 --> 27:38.280
Where did he go?

27:39.000 --> 27:40.320
It looks like

27:40.400 --> 27:42.440
he's trapped in an illusion.

27:42.520 --> 27:43.920
He can't die here.

27:44.640 --> 27:46.800
I can only try to find him
with the Chaos Power.

27:59.600 --> 28:00.800
He's not in the forest.

28:02.160 --> 28:03.400
Then, where could he be?

28:06.560 --> 28:08.680
If I give up being a divine artifact

28:08.760 --> 28:10.360
and you forget your ambition,

28:10.960 --> 28:12.760
we can, no matter
what happens in the world,

28:13.760 --> 28:15.520
guard this world

28:17.080 --> 28:18.760
and be together for 10,000 years.

28:26.440 --> 28:27.720
For 10,000 years,

28:29.000 --> 28:31.120
I have traveled
to the Celestial Realm and the Lava Chasm,

28:32.040 --> 28:34.400
beginning with ambition

28:35.600 --> 28:37.840
but ending with hatred.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.400
Only now do I realize

28:42.080 --> 28:43.720
that the memories of 10,000 years ago

28:45.240 --> 28:47.200
are deeply embedded in my heart
like my bones and blood.

28:54.000 --> 28:55.080
Zhao Ming.

28:55.600 --> 28:56.880
This time,

28:58.160 --> 29:00.720
don't leave me alone
in Everbright Palace, okay?

29:02.320 --> 29:04.200
I have owed you
an explanation for 10,000 years,

29:04.800 --> 29:05.800
and you

29:06.800 --> 29:08.680
owe me a full wedding.

29:10.080 --> 29:11.760
Tonight is an auspicious time

29:12.400 --> 29:13.960
to make up for all the regrets.

29:15.000 --> 29:16.120
From now on,

29:16.760 --> 29:19.040
there will be no more
Demon Lord and the Chaos Pearl,

29:20.320 --> 29:21.480
but only Zhao Ming

29:22.000 --> 29:23.280
and Pearl.

29:27.160 --> 29:29.160
Only Zhao Ming and Pearl.

29:33.040 --> 29:34.680
You gave me the same candy

29:35.200 --> 29:37.200
before you went on your journey.

29:39.520 --> 29:41.600
You were suppressed in the Lava Chasm
for 10,000 years.

29:41.680 --> 29:43.200
Whenever I missed you,

29:44.080 --> 29:45.520
I ate one,

29:46.400 --> 29:47.600
but it always

29:48.120 --> 29:49.880
tasted sour.

29:56.520 --> 29:57.640
Now,

29:59.040 --> 30:00.920
the candy has finally become sweet.

30:02.720 --> 30:03.920
At that time,

30:04.880 --> 30:06.600
I ate all the candies
but didn't see you come back,

30:07.440 --> 30:09.120
so I went to the barrack.

30:10.160 --> 30:11.480
Luckily, 10,000 years later,

30:12.000 --> 30:14.200
I saw you again.

30:15.840 --> 30:16.920
Zhao Ming.

30:23.240 --> 30:24.520
MARRIAGE CONTRACT

30:26.240 --> 30:27.760
After signing this marriage contract,

30:27.840 --> 30:29.480
you and I will be married forever

30:30.200 --> 30:31.440
and never be separated.

30:42.480 --> 30:45.560
So, you don't want to be with me forever?

30:48.840 --> 30:51.360
I wish I could convince myself
you're Pearl,

30:53.400 --> 30:55.040
but you're not her after all.

30:56.160 --> 30:58.960
-Why not?
-Pearl didn't eat all the candies

31:00.160 --> 31:02.840
but saved the last one
for when she went to the barrack.

31:02.920 --> 31:04.080
What's more,

31:05.160 --> 31:07.640
Pearl wouldn't set out to kill
in a marriage contract.

31:07.720 --> 31:08.760
THE CONTRACT REQUIRES A SIGNATURE
TRAPPING HIM IN THE VOID FOREVER

31:13.720 --> 31:15.000
Demon Lord broke the illusion.

31:16.000 --> 31:17.480
This backlash is so strong.

31:18.080 --> 31:19.120
Are you all right?

31:20.040 --> 31:21.120
Don't worry.

31:21.880 --> 31:23.480
Whatever happens,

31:24.080 --> 31:25.960
I have a plan.

31:27.720 --> 31:29.320
It's a long road,

31:31.120 --> 31:34.240
but it will lead to the end I want.

31:46.880 --> 31:48.160
Do you know I've been looking for you--?

31:51.400 --> 31:54.160
Look at me. I'm not the forest spirit.

31:56.920 --> 31:59.760
Why? Why was that fake,

32:00.440 --> 32:01.920
but you're real?

32:04.520 --> 32:06.320
You… You met Pearl?

32:07.640 --> 32:08.920
How did you get out?

32:12.040 --> 32:13.280
Did you kill her?

32:14.480 --> 32:16.600
She thought, as you did before,

32:16.680 --> 32:19.400
that she could control or even kill me

32:20.280 --> 32:22.000
with a few tricks.

32:22.720 --> 32:24.200
So over-confident.

32:24.280 --> 32:25.680
You've got me all wrong.

32:25.760 --> 32:27.760
I never wanted to control

32:27.840 --> 32:28.960
or even kill you.

32:34.160 --> 32:36.480
What's the difference
between so-called reclaiming and killing?

32:37.080 --> 32:38.360
It was never me

32:38.440 --> 32:40.080
you wanted to save,

32:40.920 --> 32:42.560
nor was it what you expected.

32:48.640 --> 32:50.040
I've told you everything
I need to tell you,

32:50.120 --> 32:51.480
but you always don't believe me.

32:52.160 --> 32:54.280
I've searched for you from dawn to dusk

32:54.360 --> 32:55.560
in this dangerous jungle.

32:55.640 --> 32:57.040
But what about you?

32:57.120 --> 32:59.400
When you showed up, you choked me
and even warned me.

32:59.480 --> 33:00.760
Sometimes, I wondered

33:00.840 --> 33:02.240
why I did it.

33:03.280 --> 33:05.320
I'd like to know why you did it, too.

33:07.320 --> 33:08.960
I don't want to argue with you now.

33:09.040 --> 33:10.200
It's already dark,

33:10.280 --> 33:11.480
so can we find a place to rest?

33:26.320 --> 33:28.080
You were brought into the illusion
by the fake Pearl, even though you knew

33:28.920 --> 33:30.720
there were forest spirits in the woods
that could mesmerize people.

33:32.040 --> 33:33.760
Is it because in the 10,000 years,

33:33.840 --> 33:35.480
you've been subdued in the Lava Chasm,

33:36.320 --> 33:37.800
you've suffered day and night

33:39.000 --> 33:40.520
without being able to see

33:40.600 --> 33:41.680
or talk to anyone

33:42.480 --> 33:44.600
while relying on your obsession with Pearl

33:44.680 --> 33:45.920
to sustain yourself?

33:46.000 --> 33:47.800
Don't be a wisenheimer.

33:48.960 --> 33:50.280
It won't do you any good

33:51.320 --> 33:52.680
whether you can guess or not.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.960
Do you think I'm curious?

34:02.080 --> 34:03.840
But I am curious

34:04.360 --> 34:05.760
about what's in your vision.

34:14.760 --> 34:15.639
Xie Xuechen

34:17.760 --> 34:19.000
and you.

34:21.239 --> 34:23.239
How long did it take you
to get out of the illusion?

34:24.400 --> 34:26.040
Seven or eight minutes.

34:27.199 --> 34:28.360
In terms of ruthlessness,

34:29.440 --> 34:30.400
you're the best.

34:33.080 --> 34:35.159
You also killed the fake Pearl

34:35.239 --> 34:36.719
at the end to break the illusion.

34:36.800 --> 34:38.320
In terms of ruthlessness,

34:38.400 --> 34:39.679
we are just the same.

34:45.280 --> 34:46.840
I'm not ruthless.

34:47.760 --> 34:49.880
I've been here with Xie Xuechen

34:50.639 --> 34:52.159
and met forest spirits,

34:53.280 --> 34:55.920
so I know what I've seen is false.

34:57.680 --> 34:59.440
You have his memories,

35:00.120 --> 35:01.400
but you're not him

35:02.520 --> 35:03.680
after all.

35:07.000 --> 35:09.360
I don't know when His Grace will return
from this absence.

35:09.440 --> 35:10.160
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

35:10.240 --> 35:11.760
Mu Xuanling is tricky,

35:12.640 --> 35:14.680
so will His Grace fall into her trap?

35:16.040 --> 35:18.160
In the face of invincible power,

35:18.240 --> 35:20.760
any trickery is nothing.

35:22.000 --> 35:23.360
Ignorance Demon is a case in point.

35:24.680 --> 35:26.240
Not only did he fail in his rebellion

35:26.320 --> 35:27.880
but also lost his life,

35:28.760 --> 35:30.200
never to be revived.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.480
When Ignorance Demon was around,

35:33.000 --> 35:34.520
he was always gloomy,

35:35.520 --> 35:37.240
mocking me every day for not being smart

35:37.320 --> 35:39.120
and always trying to compete with me.

35:39.200 --> 35:40.480
I was particularly annoyed with him,

35:41.680 --> 35:43.200
but after he died,

35:45.920 --> 35:47.120
I missed him quite a bit.

35:48.160 --> 35:50.120
The three of us

35:50.200 --> 35:51.720
used to be united

35:51.800 --> 35:53.040
as one,

35:54.320 --> 35:55.480
but now,

35:55.560 --> 35:57.000
it's just the two of us,

35:57.520 --> 35:59.080
so you are surely a little uncomfortable.

36:03.280 --> 36:05.320
The people of the Dark Clan
have no blood or flesh.

36:05.400 --> 36:07.200
Where would we go

36:08.400 --> 36:09.640
if we were completely dead?

36:09.720 --> 36:11.120
I don't know.

36:11.200 --> 36:12.600
I've never really died.

36:15.680 --> 36:17.080
Then how can we say

36:17.680 --> 36:18.880
we've lived

36:19.480 --> 36:20.520
if

36:21.040 --> 36:22.640
we can never truly die?

36:25.120 --> 36:26.680
It sounds like nonsense,

36:26.760 --> 36:28.600
but it seems to make sense.

36:43.120 --> 36:44.680
What brings you to the Immortal Alliance?

36:45.800 --> 36:46.760
Congratulations

36:47.520 --> 36:48.880
on leaving the temporal chaos.

36:48.960 --> 36:50.200
Congratulations?

36:50.720 --> 36:52.240
You're the one who got us in.

36:53.840 --> 36:55.720
You were meant to be there

36:56.680 --> 36:58.360
because you were connected
10,000 years ago.

36:58.960 --> 37:00.400
What happened 10,000 years ago

37:00.480 --> 37:02.200
made what just happened happen.

37:02.280 --> 37:03.600
I know you're Fate,

37:03.680 --> 37:05.800
but can Fate play

37:05.880 --> 37:07.760
with someone's life like a god?

37:09.280 --> 37:10.480
Play?

37:10.560 --> 37:13.400
I know you're running Snow City
in the name of demon removal,

37:13.480 --> 37:14.960
but I'm telling you,

37:15.040 --> 37:17.120
if you dare harm Mu Xuanling
and the Immortal Alliance,

37:17.720 --> 37:19.000
no matter how powerful you are,

37:19.080 --> 37:21.080
I'll fight you at all costs.

37:22.920 --> 37:24.160
At all costs?

37:25.440 --> 37:26.560
What if the cost

37:27.720 --> 37:29.560
is more than you can imagine?

37:34.800 --> 37:36.080
What do you want?

37:38.080 --> 37:40.440
Are you going to make an enemy of me, too?

37:40.520 --> 37:42.680
We're not on the same side anymore.

37:43.280 --> 37:44.200
You are not

37:44.280 --> 37:45.920
the same Nan Xuyue,

37:46.000 --> 37:48.120
and I am not the same Fu Lansheng.

37:48.200 --> 37:49.200
Perhaps all beings seem weak

37:49.280 --> 37:50.760
to you,

37:51.920 --> 37:52.760
but don't underestimate

37:52.840 --> 37:54.680
a weak man's fight to the death.

37:55.640 --> 37:57.360
It will also be more than you can imagine.

38:26.400 --> 38:27.400
Qiumin.

38:27.920 --> 38:29.360
Seniors.

38:30.720 --> 38:32.160
Qiumin. We're all glad

38:32.240 --> 38:33.200
to see you back safe and sound.

38:33.840 --> 38:35.040
We didn't get a chance

38:35.120 --> 38:36.520
to talk to you at the Hall of Integrity.

38:39.280 --> 38:41.800
You didn't wait for me

38:41.880 --> 38:43.280
in the freezing cold to catch up, did you?

38:48.760 --> 38:51.160
We do have important matters
to discuss with you.

38:51.240 --> 38:53.040
A long time has passed
since the war with the Spirit Clan,

38:53.120 --> 38:54.520
but there has been
no leader at Mirage Palace,

38:55.120 --> 38:56.720
so we would like to present you
as the new master.

38:57.640 --> 38:58.920
Will you do it?

39:11.560 --> 39:12.720
I am too young and unqualified

39:12.800 --> 39:13.840
for such a position.

39:16.920 --> 39:17.760
At first,

39:17.840 --> 39:20.120
we misunderstood you,

39:20.200 --> 39:21.520
but after the battle at Mirage Palace,

39:21.600 --> 39:24.240
we all saw your character and talent.

39:24.320 --> 39:25.200
Since we believe in you,

39:25.280 --> 39:27.120
why are you belittling yourself?

39:30.160 --> 39:32.240
There is no need for you to say any more.

39:32.320 --> 39:34.480
I know my own abilities best.

39:35.400 --> 39:36.560
Thank you.

39:44.280 --> 39:46.440
-Lansheng. Qiumin.
-Bao.

39:46.520 --> 39:48.720
-You're finally back.
-Bao.

39:48.800 --> 39:51.440
Why did you come?
Let me see. You've gained weight.

39:51.520 --> 39:53.160
Let me touch your belly.

39:53.240 --> 39:54.560
I haven't gained weight.

39:54.640 --> 39:57.080
You have. You've got fat on your belly.

40:03.360 --> 40:06.040
Actually,

40:06.120 --> 40:08.720
I didn't want to bring him here,

40:08.800 --> 40:11.160
but he insisted on coming with me.

40:13.240 --> 40:15.240
I'll take you to eat something nice, okay?

40:15.320 --> 40:16.760
-Okay.
-Let's go.

40:18.120 --> 40:19.400
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

40:19.480 --> 40:20.720
-Let's go.
-Go!

40:25.400 --> 40:27.360
I didn't want to talk to you,

40:29.520 --> 40:31.040
but in the course of these days,

40:32.280 --> 40:34.040
I've traveled to a place,

40:35.400 --> 40:36.960
met some people,

40:37.040 --> 40:38.440
and experienced many things.

40:39.040 --> 40:40.200
There,

40:41.040 --> 40:43.720
I really felt the true will
to save the Humans.

40:47.520 --> 40:48.960
I believe

40:50.240 --> 40:52.280
your will to save the Spirit Clan

40:53.400 --> 40:55.760
is the same as some people's will
to save the Humans.

40:57.440 --> 40:58.560
I can understand that,

40:59.280 --> 41:00.560
but I don't agree with it.

41:01.160 --> 41:02.360
Many lay down their lives

41:04.160 --> 41:05.600
to save the world.

41:06.800 --> 41:08.400
Some people's guardianship

41:08.480 --> 41:09.840
sacrifices themselves

41:11.320 --> 41:13.400
while the Decaying Immortal Pavilion's
so-called guardianship

41:13.480 --> 41:15.200
sacrifices the innocent.

41:16.320 --> 41:17.360
Your way is wrong,

41:18.080 --> 41:19.320
and the results are bad.

41:22.160 --> 41:23.600
What I did wrong was the truth.

41:23.680 --> 41:24.840
I would not be able to forgive myself

41:27.000 --> 41:28.240
if I were you,

41:29.320 --> 41:31.080
but if there is a chance to make amends,

41:31.160 --> 41:32.920
let me know,

41:33.000 --> 41:34.200
and I will do my best.

41:35.520 --> 41:36.840
That won't be necessary.

41:38.480 --> 41:39.520
I promised my parents

41:40.440 --> 41:41.920
I wouldn't live in hate,

41:43.920 --> 41:45.520
so we won't kill each other,

41:46.200 --> 41:48.440
but we won't be friends either.

41:52.280 --> 41:53.600
It's for the best

41:54.200 --> 41:55.280
that you and I

41:56.320 --> 41:57.600
have different surnames.

42:01.760 --> 42:03.040
Fu Cangli

42:03.960 --> 42:05.120
died a long time ago.

42:05.800 --> 42:06.960
There is only Jiang Li

42:09.600 --> 42:10.880
in this world.

42:30.080 --> 42:31.640
The last ripe Lotus of Life

42:32.320 --> 42:33.640
was plucked by Xie Xuechen.

42:34.160 --> 42:35.840
Now, it will take a hundred years

42:36.640 --> 42:38.440
to grow a new one.

42:38.520 --> 42:40.520
What will it be like

42:41.560 --> 42:43.200
in a hundred years?

42:44.480 --> 42:46.120
You're often reminded
of something by what you see.

42:46.200 --> 42:46.880
I…

42:49.560 --> 42:51.440
If I ask him to take out the lotus flower
from the spiritual water for me

42:51.520 --> 42:53.680
on the grounds that my Chaos Power

42:53.760 --> 42:55.840
is incomplete and was depleted
too much yesterday,

42:55.920 --> 42:57.560
will he say yes?

42:58.280 --> 42:59.200
I…

43:04.600 --> 43:06.200
You just plucked

43:06.800 --> 43:08.080
the once-in-a-century Lotus of Life?

43:08.840 --> 43:10.080
No matter how rare it is,

43:10.160 --> 43:11.880
it's just a flower.

43:11.960 --> 43:13.360
So what if I plucked it?

43:14.120 --> 43:15.480
Wait a minute.

43:19.840 --> 43:22.080
I heard there were precious spiritual fish

43:22.160 --> 43:23.240
in Everlife Pond.

43:23.320 --> 43:26.120
If we can eat them,
it will be good for cultivation.

43:26.200 --> 43:27.520
While we're here,

43:27.600 --> 43:29.600
let's catch some together.

43:30.520 --> 43:32.480
Who have you been fooled by?

43:32.560 --> 43:34.400
The pool water is evolved
from spiritual energy,

43:35.200 --> 43:36.480
not real water.

43:36.560 --> 43:37.880
So, how can there be spiritual fish?

43:37.960 --> 43:39.720
There is. Really.

43:40.400 --> 43:41.680
There it is. See it?

43:41.760 --> 43:43.680
It's swimming that way. Look at it.

43:43.760 --> 43:45.760
There it is. It's swimming that way.
Look at it.

43:45.840 --> 43:47.520
It's swimming that way.

43:47.600 --> 43:48.920
A very big fish. See it?
